{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_046rio_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_046rio_4000_situation", "source_sha256": "09fc4c1ba1d0c864a1835c6aba1547e441eede6caa886e893ed6baf737db44e3", "ja": "旅番組の撮影の合間", "zh": "旅游节目拍摄时的空挡", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_046rio_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_046rio_4000_place", "source_sha256": "7c09ecc773e6713290f186a82f5b34d4cc50783111d09ed5a430f59b3cd1001d", "ja": "温泉旅館前", "zh": "温泉旅馆前", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_046rio_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_046rio_4001_p", "source_sha256": "9912e8bbdedcb4835eed6013e14fa588a417ebf117932234737b19277dd27117", "ja": "（莉緒の軽快なトークのおかげで、旅番組の撮影は\n順調だ。最後は……視聴者プレゼントコーナーか）", "zh": "（多亏了莉绪轻快的谈话节奏，旅游节目的拍摄\n十分顺利，最后是……赠送观众礼物的单元啊。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_046rio_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_046rio_4002_046rio", "source_sha256": "e36d12b291c7922ac297cce31ba7cae3b55047e07fa06242859e9925b1c932a7", "ja": "ウフフ♪　仕事とはいえ、いい眺めのお風呂に\nおいしいお料理……温泉は最高ね♪", "zh": "呵呵♪虽说是工作，但是能享受到风景怡人的浴池和\n美味的料理……温泉真是太棒了呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_046rio_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_046rio_4003_046rio", "source_sha256": "5b124eb4c31e5e2610da08ba3e2e2e6826cfe6af78f6fcad28325cb1e721d120", "ja": "きっと私の温泉入浴シーンは、いい数字が取れると\n思うわよ♪　楽しみにしててね。", "zh": "我想我泡温泉的桥段，一定能获得高收视率的♪\n好好期待吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_046rio_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_046rio_4004_p", "source_sha256": "9b10f62a9ee589d9ad1a1802f50b14852f4b9325e569800724939ebf50e82440", "ja": "莉緒も楽しめてるみたいで、よかったよ。\nあとは、視聴者プレゼントコーナーで終わりだな。", "zh": "莉绪看来也很乐在其中，真是太好了。\n最后剩下赠送观众礼物的单元就结束了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_046rio_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_046rio_4005_046rio", "source_sha256": "a03bf2fd56a1b0d7a4d4cb28ab35749e33783d8e00554110d475166633782514", "ja": "{$P$}くん。その視聴者プレゼント、\n私が選んでいいって言われたんだけど……。", "zh": "{$P$}，工作人员说\n可以由我来挑选礼物……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_046rio_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_046rio_4006_046rio", "source_sha256": "8f9c9687c600c5e73fbccedbbe0230c17760418aac50461217862314fb7b4694", "ja": "番組を見てくれた人が、この旅の良さを分かってくれる\nものがいいなって、思うんだけど……何がいいかしら？", "zh": "我希望这份礼物能让收看这个节目的观众，\n都了解这趟旅行的美好之处……送什么好呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_046rio_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_046rio_4007_046rio", "source_sha256": "15b77d5433ae07778e1f4ec1ffa41ddcc4e9b4fc8ec4a924ec5c9bc838afe7c1", "ja": "番組の締めくくりだから、思い出になるものとか……\nあっ、ロケ地のアピールに繋がるものもいいわよね！", "zh": "毕竟是节目的结尾，像是能留下回忆的东西……\n啊，能表现外景地优点的东西也不错吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_046rio_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_046rio_4008_p", "source_sha256": "64f8927df8ac5d0666e5bafa32c0bbd0dadac7500e1150dd8d963c287e554e6e", "ja": "そうだな……。", "zh": "这个嘛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_046rio_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_046rio_4009", "source_sha256": "f1cee7b8600d5695f0d351d64097a26f8a332ce3921a71b81319ec06df2e71cb", "ja": "美肌になる石けん", "zh": "美肌香皂", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_046rio_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_046rio_4010", "source_sha256": "2f4080cb31df646a701f22b314b928586d63fdc8d0417a5633ad995b21deb9de", "ja": "温泉まんじゅう", "zh": "温泉馒头", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_046rio_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_046rio_4011", "source_sha256": "32daffde81d5454bc6c0129bd0b64ee68c99d716a2326ec17737d736bc1f1bba", "ja": "木刀", "zh": "木刀", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_046rio_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_046rio_4100_p", "source_sha256": "52f5b34e62b3ce9da223c9ad401125085df8e6bddedcc46c64221e633c8f41e1", "ja": "美肌になる石けん……っていうのはどうだ？\n温泉由来成分配合だそうだ。", "zh": "美肌香皂……怎么样？\n听说里面含有温泉的成分。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_046rio_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_046rio_4101_046rio", "source_sha256": "76f3c63e8740bdc837eb3002ce57e53035dd3019c7ff7cef9026b89e9781065f", "ja": "あら、それすっごくいいじゃない♪\nこの温泉の美容効果もアピールできるし……。", "zh": "哎呀，这还真不错呢♪\n一方面能宣传这个温泉的美容效果……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_046rio_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_046rio_4102_046rio", "source_sha256": "fa537eb83e8efbe0ce508c6cf40927f82cf246d2f6c12e03ebd4b2db1ccd1ae6", "ja": "何より、肌が綺麗になるっていうのが重要よね！\n{$P$}くんたら、やるじゃない♪", "zh": "最重要的是，肌肤能变得更好呢！\n{$P$}，你还满厉害的嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_046rio_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_046rio_4200_p", "source_sha256": "388e34bbaaaad0b3f39456b0c0b90f6ba6a0898cc611615d1182dd7cc74bbd15", "ja": "温泉まんじゅうかな。やっぱり温泉地といえば……\nって感じがするし、おすそ分けもできるし。", "zh": "温泉馒头吧，总觉得说到温泉区就会想到这个……\n也能分享给别人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_046rio_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_046rio_4201_046rio", "source_sha256": "18d45306e0a12e1de7a0744376b4d215ad142430492efdfa256c72957a1e840b", "ja": "そうね、定番だし……さっきの収録中も食べたけど、\n程よい甘さでおいしかったし。ありがと、そうするわ♪", "zh": "也对，毕竟是基本款……在刚刚拍摄中我也尝过了，\n甜得恰到好处、非常好吃。谢谢，就这么办吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_046rio_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_046rio_4300_p", "source_sha256": "eaabd849a47757eaa2e1dc8f6de489e88aa7d61d4e83ec61d744618bbd3e3eaf", "ja": "そうだな、木刀とかどうだ？\n思い出になると思うんだけど……。", "zh": "这个嘛，木刀之类的怎么样？\n我想应该能够留下回忆……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_046rio_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_046rio_4301_046rio", "source_sha256": "5468ae346eaca1df5477502848d302329178c910bf6734818ddfb0da7aa39139", "ja": "木刀……？\n喜んでくれるかしら？　なんか、人を選びそうね。", "zh": "木刀……？\n收到的人会开心吗？感觉因人而异呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
